&lt;h2 id=&#34;get-help&#34;&gt;Get Help
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Please use &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://discord.gg/JzTFvyjG6R&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
